&lt;b&gt;Attaques sp&#233;ciales&lt;/b&gt; absorption de moelle, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Constriction-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Constriction (Ext)&quot;&gt;constriction&lt;/a&gt; (1d6+6), m&#226;choires p&#233;n&#233;trantes
